== name: ldelete with linearg (plan §9.3 example)
-- file a.txt
alpha
beta
gamma
-- args a.txt
-- keys
down arg down ldelete
-- expect file a.txt
alpha
-- expect cursor 1 0
-- expect clipboard line
beta
gamma
-- expect result true

== name: arg starts arg mode and keeps the cursor
-- keys
arg
-- expect cursor 0 0
-- expect result true

== name: arg arg counts two (copy behaves like arg)
-- file a.txt
one two
-- args a.txt
-- keys
arg arg copy
-- expect clipboard stream
one two

== name: nullarg reaches the function
-- file a.txt
one two
-- args a.txt
-- keys
right right right right arg copy
-- expect clipboard stream
two

== name: textarg is typed on the dialog line
-- size 60 8
-- keys
arg "hello"
