== name: numarg becomes linearg
-- file a.txt
1
2
3
4
-- args a.txt
-- keys
arg "2" ldelete
-- expect file a.txt
3
4
-- expect clipboard line
1
2

== name: number for a function without numarg is text
-- file a.txt
x
-- args a.txt
-- keys
arg "10" paste
-- expect file a.txt
10x

== name: zero numarg is invalid
-- file a.txt
x
-- args a.txt
-- keys
arg "0" ldelete
-- expect message Invalid argument
-- expect result false
-- expect file a.txt
x

== name: streamarg on one line
