bcd

== name: streamarg leftward is the same stream
-- file a.txt
abcdef
-- args a.txt
-- keys
right right right right arg left left left copy
-- expect clipboard stream
bcd

== name: linearg same column different lines
-- file a.txt
one
two
three
-- args a.txt
-- keys
arg down down copy
-- expect clipboard line
one
two
three

== name: boxarg other line and column, right edge exclusive
-- file a.txt
abcdef
ghijkl
mnopqr
-- args a.txt
-- keys
right arg down down right right copy
-- expect clipboard box 2
bc
hi
no

